      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When the infected monsters gather,\r\nthe tainted power also accumulates.\r\nAs a result, not just the land, but\r\nwater, air, and everything becomes\r\npolluted as if tainted.",
        "Jp" : "侵食魔が集まると、汚れた力も集まり\r\nその結果、大地ばかりか、水も、空気も、全てが\r\n侵食されたように汚染されてしまうのだ"
