      "MsgSerial" : 383183,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Regardless, the cleansing of the \r\ncore vein must not be hindered \r\nby the encroaching beasts.",
        "Jp" : "ともあれ芯脈の浄化を、侵食魔に\r\n邪魔されるようなことがあってはならない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 383184,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If that is the case, clearing the \r\nmonsters lurking inside the tree \r\nmust take precedence.",
