      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Please remain vigilant and \r\ncleanse the tree of the \r\nencroaching monsters.",
        "Jp" : "くれぐれも警戒しつつ\r\n樹内の侵食魔を掃討して欲しい"
